Package: footyforecast.extract
Title: FootyForecast R Layer (data extraction + HGA report)
Version: 0.1.0
Description: R is used for two things only: pulling AFL data with fitzRoy into
    parquet (R/extract_data.R) and the home-ground-advantage analysis report
    (R/reports/home_ground_advantage.qmd). Modelling lives in Python.
    This file exists so renv can snapshot dependencies explicitly.
